  "configuration_id": "config_011",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA multiprofile scVI is strongest, but image-only ResNet single-profile is weak and the only multimodal ResNet/concat test did not beat RNA-only. It remains unclear whether the poor multimodal result is due to weak image signal, lack of multiprofile aggregation for images, or fusion. config_011 tests image-only ResNet with multiprofile avgpool, a minimal extension of the image baseline that isolates profile/aggregation without adding RNA or fusion. If it improves, image may be worth further fusion or stronger encoder exploration; if not, it argues against investing in ResNet-based multimodal variants, making it a high-information, low-complexity next step."
}

